    "note": "Trail 604.1 from the Blue Lake/Dock Butte Trailhead, where a recreation pass is required. The trail itself is not named in any closure. The trail page's active alert says FSR 12 and FSR 1230, the road to the parking area, will be closed for repairs in August; the alert gives no year."
