    "climbable": false,
    "drive_up": null,
    "trail_note": "Trail 604.1: 0.2 miles from the Blue Lake trailhead to the Dock Butte junction, then 1.5 miles to the lookout site; the last half mile is moderately steep and exposed. Carry water; none is available at the site. No structure remains to climb."
  },
